On 7 October 2011 11:57, Nick Schurch <N.Schurch at dundee.ac.uk> wrote:

> r('estimateVarianceFunctions <-
> function(){load("mySavedR.rdata")\nx=estimateVarianceFunctions(z)\nreturn(x)}')
